      "text": "A robot needs to cross a maze. What should we give it first?",
      "art": "object.puzzle",
      "video": "kidzo:logic-sequences",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "sequence",
          "label": "A sequence of steps",
          "art": "object.footprints",
          "next": "sequence"
        },
        {
          "id": "loop",
          "label": "A loop",
          "art": "object.circle",
          "next": "loop"
        },
        {
          "id": "guess",
          "label": "A random guess",
          "art": "object.question",
          "next": "guess"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "sequence",
      "text": "Step, step, turn. The robot follows our steps in order.",
      "art": "object.footprints",
      "video": "kidzo:logic-sequences",
      "next": "condition"
    },
    {
      "id": "loop",
      "text": "Repeat four times: step. A loop saves time!",
      "art": "object.circle",
      "video": "kidzo:logic-loops",
      "next": "condition"
    },
    {
      "id": "guess",
      "text": "Random guesses make the robot bump into walls. A plan works better, so we write one.",
      "art": "object.question",
      "next": "condition"
    },
    {
      "id": "condition",
      "text": "If there is a wall, then turn. The robot makes smart choices.",
      "art": "object.puzzle",
      "video": "kidzo:logic-conditions",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "fix",
          "label": "Test and fix bugs",
          "art": "object.sparkles",
          "next": "fix"
        },
        {
          "id": "rush",
          "label": "Run it untested",
          "art": "object.rocket",
          "next": "rush"
        },
        {
          "id": "ask",
          "label": "Ask a friend to check",
          "art": "object.friends",
          "next": "fix"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "fix",
      "text": "We found a bug and fixed it. Debugging success!",
      "art": "object.sparkles",
      "video": "kidzo:logic-debugging",
      "next": "end"
    },
    {
      "id": "rush",
      "text": "Oops, the robot spins in circles. Testing first would have caught that bug.",
      "art": "object.rocket",
      "next": "fix"
    },
    {
      "id": "end",
      "text": "The robot escaped the maze. You think like a coder!",
      "art": "zo.celebrating",
      "ending": true
